Per this lane's permissions ("Do NOT create a Fly account or app"), no
`fly launch` or `fly deploy` was run even though `fly auth whoami` succeeds
— launching would create a real app under Noel's account, which is out of
scope for this lane regardless of whether a token is present. The exact
commands for Noel (or a later, explicitly-gated lane) to run are in
docs/self-hosting.md's Fly section:
  fly launch --copy-config --name <app-name> --now=false
  fly secrets set SOTTO_API_KEY=sk-...
  fly deploy

