=== Escalate note (not made — outside this lane's permitted paths) ===
The image would be meaningfully smaller with a `pnpm deploy --filter
@sotto/server` prod-only stage instead of shipping the full monorepo
install, but @sotto/server's own package.json has no "build" script and
runs its TypeScript source directly via a devDependency (tsx) — trimming
that would mean either adding a build step to apps/server/package.json
(compile to JS, drop tsx/typescript from the runtime image) or changing
how apps/server is started. That's a change to apps/server/**, out of this
lane's permitted paths — named here rather than made.
